This creates a self-healing metadata architecture:

Using **`.lc.md` Markdown sidecars** to maintain an immutable provenance anchor (original filename, content hash, and origin metadata), your files become **immune to accidental moves, folder reshuffling, or renaming**.

If a file gets moved into a random subfolder, renamed by an external app, or misplaced during a backup, the Anymd background scanner reads the paired **`.lc.md`** sidecar, immediately recognizes the lost document, and **absorbs the new physical path into the database index automatically**.

